  "title": "Different Chicken Cordon Bleu",
  "description": "This casserole still features ham and Swiss cheese with chicken, but strays from the original with a sauce of cream soup, sour cream and wine. Stuffing mix tops the entire creation.",
  "authors": [
    "Jennifer"
